# e2e/.env — copy to e2e/.env for the ON-CHAIN journey. Never commit real keys.
# The no-wallet (board) and headless-wallet (onboard) journeys need NONE of these.

# Point the suite at an already-running stack instead of booting local dev servers.
# When set, Playwright skips its webServer + globalSetup and just drives this URL.
# E2E_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5173
# E2E_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787

# ── on-chain journey (E2E_ONCHAIN=1) — Base Sepolia, needs funds + secrets ────────────────
# A Base Sepolia RPC endpoint (the indexer + the test wallet read/write through it).
# E2E_RPC_URL=https://sepolia.base.org
# A funded testnet wallet (Base Sepolia ETH for gas + testnet USDC). Testnet only — never mainnet.
# E2E_WALLET_PK=0x...
# The indexer's reconcile bearer, so the test can nudge a pass instead of waiting on the */2 cron.
# E2E_RECONCILE_TOKEN=...
# The indexer origin used for the reconcile nudge (defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8788).
# E2E_INDEXER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8788
# Escrow + USDC addresses (canonical source: @buyananswer/shared escrowDeployments). Passed via env so
# this standalone package keeps zero address literals. Defaults to the Base Sepolia deployment.
# E2E_ESCROW=0x40A4bfEc9441752BcABBd4b3939503671c8724dB
# E2E_USDC=0x036CbD53842c5426634e7929541eC2318f3dCF7e

# ── multi-actor harness (Session 17) — `pnpm run wallets` then `pnpm run test:harness` ─────
# The harness reuses E2E_RPC_URL + E2E_RECONCILE_TOKEN above; it needs no extra secrets. Its five
# testnet wallets are generated into e2e/.harness/wallets.json (git-ignored) — never put keys here.
# `pnpm run test:harness` sets E2E_HARNESS=1 itself (it boots the indexer + writes its .dev.vars).
